WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,750 --> 00:00:03,740
It turns out that this knife has an owner.

2
00:00:03,740 --> 00:00:08,040
The person who has been reporting wanting to buy this knife is you.

3
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:12,660
Do you know how to use a Miao Dao or just think you like it?

4
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:14,980
I learned it when I was a child

5
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:16,380
This knife is not for sale

6
00:00:16,810 --> 00:00:17,810
except this knife

7
00:00:18,010 --> 00:00:20,570
That's a good hand-to-hand gift for you.

8
00:00:21,450 --> 00:00:23,050
No thanks, big boss

9
00:00:23,050 --> 00:00:24,050
I'm leaving first

10
00:00:24,250 --> 00:00:32,320
Finally, I don’t have to worry about it all the time.

11
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:38,350
Just waiting for you

12
00:00:38,750 --> 00:00:40,350
There are many shops open today

13
00:00:40,350 --> 00:00:41,750
You can also buy some food on the way

14
00:00:41,950 --> 00:00:43,750
The elderly at home heard that you are going

15
00:00:43,950 --> 00:00:45,750
I'm so happy to make some stewed chicken for you.

16
00:00:45,950 --> 00:00:47,950
Hurry up and go back to eat local chicken

17
00:00:48,150 --> 00:00:56,770
I heard that an employee in the elevator had a scary illness.

18
00:00:56,970 --> 00:00:58,370
Fortunately we took the stairs

19
00:00:58,770 --> 00:00:59,770
It's terrible

20
00:01:00,680 --> 00:01:02,680
Stop talking and get in the car.
